Meanwhile performed TBT prior to P/U BHA#1 perforation gun.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T05:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U BHA#1, perforation gun and started to install same in lubricator.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T07:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued installing BHA#1 into lubricator.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T07:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T07:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT prior to finalize installation of BHA.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T07:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T08:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Finalized installation of BHA#1.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T08:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T09:55:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested QTS to 20/345 bar for 5/10 min. Checked valve status on WL rig-up, well and pump units.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T09:55:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T10:35:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held well contoll drill with WL crew prior to RIH.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T10:35:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T12:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Opened well and pumped 1500 litres of MEG with AWS pressure test pump. Observed 1,23 bar pressure increase in WHP and no changes on DHPG. Also observed gas in return from lubricator. Concluded that there was a larger volume of gas above DHSV. Decided to use a larger volume pump to pump MEG.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T12:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Discussed further action and decided to rig up hose from platform MEG system to kill wing valve.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T14:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed swab valve. Rigged up hose from platform MEG system to chiksan on kill wing valve. Pumped 1500 litres and equalized/opened DHSV with 88 bar WHP. Also observed pressure increase on DHPG. Filled up and pressured up lubricator to 88 bar. Opened swab valve.
Meanwhile lifted perforation guns for run#2 onto HTS (Horisontal transfer system) with rig crane.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T14:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T17:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3302</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ BHA#1, 4,72&quot; OD guns from 0 m to 3302 m MD RKB.  Could not pass 3302 m MD RKB.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T17:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T18:35:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3276</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Tried several times to pass 3302 m MD RKB, no-go. Max speed 20 m/min. Correlated and positioned guns at firing depth. Perforated between 3264-3276 m MD RKB. WHP dropped from 88 to 85,5 bar. DHPG dropped from 319 to 316 bar. Observed drop in HW.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T18:35:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T20:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">550</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/ BHA #1, 4,72&quot; OD guns from 3276 to 550 m MD RKB. Observed 300 lbs higher PW.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T20:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T20:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">550</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT prior to POOH and L/D BHA#1, 4,72&quot; OD guns.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T20:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T21:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 550 m to 0 m. WHP 85 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T21:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T22:50:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>OOH. Closed swab valve and HMV and inflow tested same. Flushed lubricator with nitrogen. 
Meanwhile lifted perforation gun for run#3 and 4 onto HTS (Horisontal transfer system) with rig crane.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T22:50:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-22T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D BHA#1 4,72&quot; OD guns on drill floor and inspected same. All shots fired.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2013-12-22T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2013-12-23T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Checked cable head and prepared BHA#2 4.72&quot; OD guns.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
